मील् मीलति pp. मीलित (q.v.) close the eyes, wink (also
= मिल्). C. मीलयति close, shut. — आ & व्या C. close (the eyes).
उद् open, expand, (trans. & intr.);
 come forth, appear. C. open,
expand, manifest. प्रोद् & समुद् = उद् (also C.). नि shut the eyes,
wink;
 close, contract (intr.);
 disappear, vanish. C. shut or cause to
shut. सम् close the eyes;
 close up, contract (intr.). C. close, shut.
— Cf. उन्मीलित, निमीलित, संमीलित.

मीलित a. having closed the eyes, sleepy or asleep;
 closed,
shut;
 vanished, disappeared, gone;
 also = मिलित.
